{
  "name": "search filters a global ranking, leaving gaps where inactive people sit",
  "description": "ADR-0005 gates plus RFC-0008 §1a. Rank is computed over the whole scored population and the default view FILTERS that ranking rather than recomputing it, so a hidden contributor leaves a hole in the sequence. Carol scores 71.5 — the highest Postgres score on the platform — and has lapsed availability, so a default Postgres search starts at rank 2.\n\nThat is the point: the count is what the hirer asked for, and which people fill it is what include_inactive changes. inactive_hidden is returned so the hole reads as a filter rather than a bug.\n\nThe three permanent gates are unaffected and remain SQL, not post-filters: only primary standing matches a skill filter (dave's Go scores 81 as a secondary and is unsearchable at any threshold), AssertNotSelf removes dave from dave_hiring's results without affecting anyone else's, and not_looking is excluded with no toggle that reveals it.",
  "seed": ["principals", "catalogue", "repositories", "scored_population"],
  "steps": [
    {
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/search?skills=postgres"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 200,
        "_note": "THE GAP. One result, and its rank is 2 — Carol holds rank 1 and is inactive. A recruiter seeing a list that starts at 2 is being told something true.",
        "body": {
          "total": 1,
          "inactive_hidden": 1,
          "ranked_by": "skill:postgres",
          "page": 1,
          "per_page": 20,
          "results": [
            {
              "rank": 2,
              "id": "<uuid>",
              "display_name": "Bob Nakamura",
              "github_login": "bobn",
              "active": true,
              "availability": {
                "status": "looking_for_freelance",
                "expires_at": "<timestamp>"
              },
              "skills": [
                {
                  "slug": "postgres",
                  "standing": "primary",
                  "score": 48.0,
                  "rank": 2
                }
              ],
              "overall_score": 60.4,
              "generalist_score": 122.7
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_step": "Toggle inactive on. Carol returns AT HER TRUE RANK — the ranking was never recomputed, only filtered.",
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "path": "/search?skills=postgres&include_inactive=true"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 200,
        "body": {
          "total": 2,
          "inactive_hidden": 0,
          "ranked_by": "skill:postgres",
          "page": 1,
          "per_page": 20,
          "results": [
            {
              "rank": 1,
              "id": "<uuid>",
              "display_name": "Carol Diaz",
              "github_login": "cdiaz",
              "_note": "Both staleness numbers. last_confirmed_at is how stale the signal is; inactive_for_days is how long she has been gone. They differ by the 15-day window.",
              "active": false,
              "availability": {
                "status": "looking_for_job",
                "last_confirmed_at": "<timestamp>",
                "inactive_for_days": 1
              },
              "skills": [
                {
                  "slug": "postgres",
                  "standing": "primary",
                  "score": 71.5,
                  "rank": 1
                }
              ],
              "overall_score": 71.5,
              "generalist_score": 71.5
            },
            {
              "rank": 2,
              "id": "<uuid>",
              "display_name": "Bob Nakamura",
              "github_login": "bobn",
              "active": true,
              "availability": {
                "status": "looking_for_freelance",
                "expires_at": "<timestamp>"
              },
              "skills": [
                {
                  "slug": "postgres",
                  "standing": "primary",
                  "score": 48.0,
                  "rank": 2
                }
              ],
              "overall_score": 60.4,
              "generalist_score": 122.7
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
